---
import LegalLayout from '@/layouts/LegalLayout.astro';
import { firm, firmPolicyLinks } from '@/config/site';
---

<LegalLayout
  title="Privacy Policy"
  description="How the Hoffman Legal demand letter website collects, uses and protects the information you submit, including intake form data, browser storage and server logs."
>
  {/*
    Draft for attorney review. Describes this website as built: no analytics, no
    advertising trackers and no cookies set by the site. Update this page if
    analytics, a form service or other third-party tools are added.
  */}
  <p>
    This policy explains how the {firm.name} demand letter website handles information.
    {
      firmPolicyLinks.privacy ? (
        <>
          It supplements {firm.name}’s <a href={firmPolicyLinks.privacy}>firm-wide privacy policy</a>.
        </>
      ) : (
        <>For information about the firm generally, visit <a href={firm.website}>hoffman.legal</a>.</>
      )
    }
  </p>

  <h2>Information you provide</h2>
  <p>
    If you submit a request, you provide your name, email address, phone number, the state where the dispute arose, and
    information about your dispute and the other party. We use this information to review your inquiry, run a conflict
    check and contact you about your request. Please do not submit Social Security numbers, financial account or card
    numbers, passwords, medical records or other highly sensitive information through the form.
  </p>

  <h2>Information stored in your browser</h2>
  <p>
    While you complete the request form, your answers are kept temporarily in your browser’s session storage so they are
    not lost if the page reloads. This copy stays on your device, is removed when you close the browser tab, and is
    cleared after a successful submission.
  </p>

  <h2>Cookies and analytics</h2>
  <p>
    This website does not set its own cookies and does not use analytics or advertising trackers. Our web hosting
    provider may keep standard server logs, such as IP addresses and pages requested, for security and operation of the
    site.
  </p>

  <h2>How information is shared</h2>
  <p>
    We do not sell personal information. Information you submit is used by {firm.name} to evaluate and respond to your
    inquiry. Request form submissions are delivered to the firm through Formspree, a third-party form-processing
    service, and may also be processed by the provider that hosts this website.
  </p>

  <h2>Confidentiality</h2>
  <p>
    Submitting information through this website does not create an attorney-client relationship. Information sent before
    a relationship is formed may not be protected in the same way as communications with a client.
  </p>

  <h2>Contact</h2>
  <p>
    Questions about this policy can be sent to <a href={`mailto:${firm.email}`}>{firm.email}</a> or {firm.legalName},
    {firm.address.street}, {firm.address.city}, {firm.address.region} {firm.address.postalCode}.
  </p>
</LegalLayout>
